<headline>Derma Sciences FY 1996 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>OLD FORGE, Pa. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.34  proifit	 $0.03</p>
